{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"2379","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v7190","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"REN(原画)","creatorId":"egs:creator:1603","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:1603","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:1603","name":"REN(原画)","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"ambiguous-alias-review","relationId":"egs:work-creator:3263","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"えのもとひろあき","creatorId":"vndb:s3293","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2008","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3293","name":"えのもとひろあき","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:12420","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"Freyr","creatorId":"egs:creator:3566","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:3566","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:3566","name":"Freyr","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"alias-only-review","relationId":"egs:work-creator:12421","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"白木屋","creatorId":"vndb:s2196","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:3567","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2196","name":"白木屋","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:12422","source":"egs"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"如月まさと","creatorId":"vndb:s6281","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2989","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6281","name":"如月まさと","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:12423","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"八霧翔","creatorId":"vndb:s8856","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2986","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8856","name":"八霧翔","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:12424","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"D!","creatorId":"vndb:s8857","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2988","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8857","name":"D!","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:12425","source":"egs"}],"other":[{"creditedName":"みとせのりこ","creatorId":"vndb:s788","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:4493","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s788","name":"みとせのりこ","detail":"主題歌「蝉時雨」、ED曲「Forever Your's」","roleCode":"vocalist","roleLabel":"歌手","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:64343","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"みとせ のりこ","creatorId":"vndb:s788","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s788","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s788","name":"みとせ のりこ","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:69544","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"みとせ のりこ","creatorId":"vndb:s788","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s788","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s788","name":"みとせ のりこ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:69545","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c10579","characterName":"御堂 春菜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"144646","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"72284"}],"egsCharacterIds":["12283"],"vndbCharacterId":"c10579"},"originalCharacterName":"御堂 春菜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"夏休みを利用して診療所に遊びにやってきた世間知らずの主人公の従妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"過去に、川で溺れているところを主人公に助けられ、それ以来、主人公を慕うようになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、病弱な主人公が川に飛び込んで助けたことが、病状の悪化に繋がってはいまいかと気に病んでいるようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は、明朗快活でおっちょこちょい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「兄さま」と慕う主人公の侍女となった美夏に嫉妬している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12283","sourceWorkId":"2379","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"母方の従妹で、主人公を「兄さま」と慕う年下の女の子。 夏休みを利用して療養所に遊びに来ている。過去に病弱な主人公に川で溺れているのを助けられた事があり、以来、主人公の事を慕っている。またその事が負い目となっており、主人公を元気にしようと色々とするが、常に空回りしてしまう。 性格は明るく元気でオッチョコチョイ。主人公付けの侍女となった美夏に対しヤキモチを焼いている。 良家であるのを鼻にかけたりしないが、世間知らずなところがある。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"144646"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/de/de229de06df70751bb2af0ebdf3fffdc3b061966b4f1b8a68ebc25d4d2d35c25.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/07/079d35094fa09b3a0ff3200d64e92dd0e817ec79e2f7085921b76c17a7512bb9.webp","width":185,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岩城由奈","creatorId":"vndb:s3063","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3063","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3063","name":"岩城 由奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:72284:144646:45094:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c10587","characterName":"桜庭 美夏","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"144644","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"72284"}],"egsCharacterIds":["12281"],"vndbCharacterId":"c10587"},"originalCharacterName":"桜庭 美夏","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who came to the sanatorium to be Koutarou's handmaiden. Minatsu is originally from a well-to-do family, but they and their assets were lost in the Great Kanto earthquake of 1923."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10587"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の侍女として診療所にやってきた少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元々良家の娘だったが関東大震災で家を焼かれ、家族を失い、特権階級や高級官僚向けの娼館に引き取られる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そこで主人に従うよう徹底的に教育されるが、商品価値を下げないために純潔（処女）は守られた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、そうした不幸な境遇から心を閉ざしてしまい、無口で無感情になってしまっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12281","sourceWorkId":"2379","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の侍女となるべく、療養所にやってきた少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身の回りの世話だけでなく、夜伽の相手も勤める様躾けられている。関東大震災で家、家族共に失ってしまう。元々はそれなりの良家の娘だったが、家族や財産を失い、特権階級や高級官僚向けの娼館に引き取られる。そこで主人の世話や言う事を聞くよう徹底的に仕込まれる。また、自分の運命に対して悲観的になっていて全てを受け入れるというかたちで人生から逃げている。 話し口調は控えめで、誰に対しても敬語を使う。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"144644"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a0/a0fd7494835ca295e187501f36a9f43a4e885b5ed36130c6329c96fbf5b2b740.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/787ea57e7bdf5b071e269055c6ffd507c1b15efe484f28701bc97b8f4b93ea82.webp","width":170,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤咲かおり","creatorId":"vndb:s1182","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1182","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1182","name":"韮井叶","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:72284:144644:6105:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c10588","characterName":"門野 秋乃","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"144645","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"72284"}],"egsCharacterIds":["12282"],"vndbCharacterId":"c10588"},"originalCharacterName":"門野 秋乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"3年前から主人公付きの看護士となった女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元々は美輪家の長男である宗一郎の侍女であったが、その宗一郎から主人公の世話を申し付かり、現在に至る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"宗一郎に恋心を抱いていた頃もあったが、今ではそれが尊敬に変わってしまっているようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は、おっとりしておりマイペースを崩さない、ちょっぴり天然系のお姉さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家族から疎まれ、隔離された主人公が気兼ねなく話せる数少ない人物。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12282","sourceWorkId":"2379","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"3年ほど前から主人公付きの住み込み看護婦となった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の姉的存在で、主人公が気兼ねなく話せる数少ない人物だ。家族から疎まれ、隔離された主人公の事を可哀想におもっているが、それが同情なのか愛情なのかは分かっていない。彼女は生い立ちは不明だが、美夏と同じく高級娼館から三輪の家に長男、宗一郎の侍女として引き取られる。宗一郎は秋乃に対して、自由を与えたが秋乃自身は宗一郎のそばで働く事を希望し、身の回りの世話をしていた。少し天然系だが、時々鋭い事を言ったり、皮肉をいったりする。話し口調はやさしく、おっとりした感じ。ただし、好きな事や楽しい事に関してはやたらと饒舌になる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"144645"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/4221e49b519b3bffe6dd21ec5505727ecd13ec34b138e3202faa6ca2f0866098.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a1/a19930c6f69a4b859e9951c0000649e13971da111807111620a308122c86fcaf.webp","width":198,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"力丸乃りこ","creatorId":"vndb:s471","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s471","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s471","name":"力丸 乃りこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:72284:144645:4689:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c10580","characterName":"美夜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c10580"},"originalCharacterName":"美夜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Koutarou's pet cat. Although she looks young, she is over 300 years old."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10580"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8ef526d82a8c81bee88146387f2a33ad960072743538878babb1ac1f567da0be.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2b/2b739e3aea1f85340327b5988ea336427af57850049d44024fdb12e9dcbba906.webp","width":160,"height":230,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"金田 まひる","creatorId":"vndb:s485","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s485","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s485","name